===Format===
* '''Swiss Stage:'''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** All matches ''(excl. elimination/advancement)'' are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
*** The elimination & advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** The {{Abbr|Buchholz system|Ranking based on opponents' performance}} is used to seed matches from Round 3 to 5
** Top 5 teams advance to Stage 1 of the Major
** The next 3 teams proceed to the Play-In Stage
** Bottom 8 teams are eliminated

